  DialogueNodeData:
  - NodeGUID: da570d38-6ecc-4c97-83c8-116f6169e2d1
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: 'Good Evening! This is my final project for the last year of Game
      Programming '
    Position: {x: 211.2, y: 188}
  - NodeGUID: 2b6698e4-0a7a-44cb-afc1-45fecb405daa
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: 'I''ve always loved visual novels, to the point that i decided
      to study game programming just to learn how to do them. '
    Position: {x: 848.8, y: 188}
  - NodeGUID: 2226dffd-6d6b-4e11-b5c6-66158b55f7cd
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: When i was working on my personal project, i asked my self "how
      can i make dialogues easy for the game designers?"
    Position: {x: 1692.8, y: 188}
  - NodeGUID: 1edf93f2-3f30-48c1-8d4e-b41b3abd7d0f
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: Then I started to create this dialogue system graph based!
    Position: {x: 2558.4, y: 188}
  - NodeGUID: fac3b8e3-beec-4259-abac-cdc4005bf868
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: It's still in a seeding phase, so it's not perfect but it's usable
      and dynamic (and im pretty proud about it)
    Position: {x: 2558.4, y: 318.4}
  - NodeGUID: ecca4a59-7851-4de1-87b2-d50f9845bdbb
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: Click WASD to move, E to interact with the actors and left button
      mouse to go through the dialogues.
    Position: {x: 2473.6, y: 460}
  - NodeGUID: fc383320-8f96-47fe-b8bd-329412e74e70
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: Did you understand?
    Position: {x: 3197.6, y: 460}
  - NodeGUID: 03e04ccb-e477-43a1-af2b-2a1207f2ee39
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: Then let's go to the room in front of us!
    Position: {x: 3574.4, y: 484}
  - NodeGUID: d28db738-dd1b-448e-a2d8-e01451f69c15
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: Don't worry, i will explain it to you again
    Position: {x: 3248, y: 652.8}
  - NodeGUID: b8599f29-18e4-4859-a63c-13996ee48a0c
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: We can start the tutorial, shall we?
    Position: {x: 1960.8, y: 444}
  - NodeGUID: 9ae11d36-3fee-4bee-8657-c252460e6a57
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: Well, we don't really have a choice, don't we?
    Position: {x: 2073.6, y: 605.6}
  - NodeGUID: c33791b7-a3b4-4a49-98ae-977d925f187f
    ActorText: Elo
    DialogueText: There is also a shader because i love graphics and vfx, but it's
      not the main part (also dont try to swim i didnt add an animation for it)
    Position: {x: 1914.4, y: 318.4}
